 "sentences": [
  {
   "text": "Your Windows PC is slow, and here are six free fixes in one minute.",
   "s": 0.06,
   "e": 4.235
  },
  {
   "text": "Number six is the one most people never find.",
   "s": 4.655,
   "e": 7.592
  },
  {
   "text": "Fix one: press Control, Shift, Escape, and open Startup apps.",
   "s": 8.012,
   "e": 11.964
  },
  {
   "text": "Disable the apps you don't need when your PC starts.",
   "s": 12.384,
   "e": 15.195
  },
  {
   "text": "Fix two: on Processes, sort by CPU.",
   "s": 15.615,
   "e": 18.279
  },
  {
   "text": "If one app is eating your processor, save your work and click End task.",
   "s": 18.699,
   "e": 22.882
  },
  {
   "text": "Fix three: if the taskbar freezes, restart Windows Explorer instead of your PC.",
   "s": 23.302,
   "e": 28.888
  },
  {
   "text": "Your open apps stay open.",
   "s": 29.308,
   "e": 30.708
  },
  {
   "text": "Fix four: in Settings, open Storage Sense and turn on automatic cleanup.",
   "s": 31.128,
   "e": 36.016
  },
  {
   "text": "Set it to run every week, and Windows deletes junk files for you.",
   "s": 36.436,
   "e": 40.334
  },
  {
   "text": "Fix five: in Installed apps, sort by size.",
   "s": 40.754,
   "e": 43.363
  },
  {
   "text": "Uninstall the big apps you never use, but only ones you recognize.",
   "s": 43.783,
   "e": 48.197
  },
  {
   "text": "Fix six: search for performance, and open Adjust the appearance and performance of Windows.",
   "s": 48.617,
   "e": 54.022
  },
  {
   "text": "Choose Adjust for best performance, then click OK.",
   "s": 54.442,
   "e": 57.388
  },
  {
   "text": "Windows looks a little plainer, but it responds faster.",
   "s": 57.808,
   "e": 60.94
  },
  {
   "text": "None of these fixes delete your files.",
   "s": 61.36,
   "e": 63.452
  },
  {
   "text": "Save this video, so you can do it later.",
   "s": 63.872,
   "e": 66.18
  },
  {
   "text": "Follow for more Windows fixes every day.",
   "s": 66.6,
   "e": 68.834
  }
 ]
